ke General Drakkisath's Command to Marshal Maxwell in Burning Steppes."},nx={5102}},{i=5102,n="General Drakkisath's Demise",l=60,r=55,x=9950,f=14,sd=1,h=4,s={{k="n",i=9560,n="Marshal Maxwell",z=46,c={[46]={{84.7,69}}}}},e={{k="n",i=9560,n="Marshal Maxwell",z=46,c={[46]={{84.7,69}}}}},o={"Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy General Drakkisath. Return to Marshal Maxwell when the job is done.",""},ot={"General Drakkisath"},p={5089}},{i=5127,n="The Demon Forge",l=60,r=55,x=8300,f=654,sd=3,h=7,s={{k="n",i=10918,n="Lorax",z=618,c={[618]={{63.8,73.8}}}}},e={{k="n",i=10918,n="Lorax",z=618,c={[618]={{63.8,73.8}}}}},o={"Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Goraluk Anvilcrack. Slay him and then use the Blood Stained Pike upon his corpse. After his soul has been siphoned, the pike will be Soul Stained.","","You must also find the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate.","","Return both the Soul Stained Pike and the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate to Lorax in Winterspring."},ot={"Soul Stained Pike","Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate"},p={5126},c={"WARRIOR","PALADIN"},pf="Blacksmithing (270)"},{i=7761,n="Blackhand's Command",l=60,r=55,x=6600,f=14,sd=3,h=2,s={{k="i",i=18987,n="Blackhand's Command",d={"Scarshield Quartermaster"}}},e={{k="o",i=179880,n="Drakkisath's Brand",z=1583}},o={"That is one stupid orc. It would appear as if you need to find this brand and gain the Mark of Drakkisath in order to access the Orb of Command.","","The letter indicates that General Drakkisath guards the brand. Perhaps you should investigate."}},{i=4734,n="Egg Freezing",l=60,r=57,x=8300,f=14,sd=3,h=4,s={{k="n",i=10267,n="Tinkee Steamboil",z=46,c={[46]={{65.2,24}}}}},e={{k="n",i=10267,n="Tinkee Steamboil",z=46,c={[46]={{65.2,24}}}}},o={"Use the Eggscilloscope Prototype on an egg in the Rookery."},ot={"Rookery Egg"},p={4810,4907},nx={4735}},{i=4735,n="Egg Collection",l=60,r=57,x=9950,f=14,sd=3,h=4,s={{k="n",i=10267,n="Tinkee Steamboil",z=46,c={[46]={{65.2,24}}}}},e={{k="n",i=10267,n="Tinkee Steamboil",z=46,c={[46]={{65.2,24}}}}},o={"Bring 8 Collected Dragon Eggs and the Collectronic Module to Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest in the Burning Steppes."},ot={"Rookery Egg"},p={4734},nx={5522}},{i=4742,n="Seal of Ascension",l=60,r=57,x=8300,f=6,sd=3,h=1,s={{k="n",i=10299,n="Scarshield Infiltrator",z=1583}},e={{k="n",i=10299,n="Scarshield Infiltrator",z=1583}},o={"Find the three gemstones of command: The Gemstone of Smolderthorn, Gemstone of Spirestone, and Gemstone of Bloodaxe. Return them, along with the Unadorned Seal of Ascension, to Vaelan.","","The Generals, as told to you by Vaelan, are: War Master Voone of the Smolderthorn; Highlord Omokk of the Spirestone; and Overlord Wyrmthalak of the Bloodaxe."},ot={"Gemstone of Spirestone","Gemstone of Smolderthorn","Gemstone of Bloodaxe","Unadorned Seal of Ascension"},ob={{k="item",n="Unadorned Seal of Ascension",z={[10074]={{49.1,64.1}}}}},nx={4743}},{i=4743,n="Seal of Ascension",l=60,r=57,x=9950,f=6,sd=3,h=1,s={{k="n",i=10299,n="Scarshield Infiltrator",z=1583}},e={{k="n",i=10299,n="Scarshield Infiltrator",z=1583}},o={"Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh. Find the ancient drake, Emberstrife and beat him without mercy until his will is broken.","","It is at that moment which you must place the Unforged Seal of Ascension before the great beast. You must then be quick to use the Orb of Draconic Energy on his weakened form and claim dominion over his mental faculties. Control the beast and force the Flames of the Black Dragonflight upon the Unforged Seal of Ascension!"},ot={"Forged Seal of Ascension"},ob={{k="item",n="Forged Seal of Ascension",z={[15]={{56.4,87.8}}}},{k="event",n="Beat Emberstrife till his will is broke…",z={[15]={{56.7,87.7}}}},{k="event",n="Use the Flames of the Black Flight over…",z={[15]={{56.4,87.8}}}}},p={4742}},{i=4764,n="Doomrigger's Clasp",l=60,r=57,x=1650,f=14,sd=1,h=4,s={{k="n",i=9565,n="Mayara Brightwing",z=46,c={[46]={{84.8,69.1}}}}},e={{k="n",i=9565,n="Mayara Brightwing",z=46,c={[46]={{84.8,69.1}}}}},o={"Bring Doomrigger's Clasp to Mayara Brightwing in the Burning Steppes."},ot={"Doomrigger's Clasp"},p={4766},nx={4765}},{i=4765,n="Delivery to Ridgewell",l=60,r=57,x=6600,f=14,sd=1,h=4,s={{k="n",i=9565,n="Mayara Brightwing",z=46,c={[46]={{84.8,69.1}}}}},e={{k="n",i=2285,n="Count Remington Ridgewell",z=1519,c={[1519]={{76.9,47.8}}}}},o={"Bring Ridgewell's Crate to Remington Ridgewell in Stormwind."},p={4764}},{i=4766,n="Mayara Brightwing",l=60,r=57,x=660,f=14,sd=1,h=6,s={{k="n",i=2285,n="Count Remington Ridgewell",z=1519,c={[1519]={{76.9,47.8}}}}},e={{k="n",i=9565,n="Mayara Brightwing",z=46,c={[46]={{84.8,69.1}}}}},o={"Speak with Mayara Brightwing in the Burning Steppes."},nx={4764}},{i=4907,n="Tinkee Steamboil",l=60,r=57,x=660,f=14,sd=3,h=7,s={{k="n",i=10468,n="Felnok Steelspring",z=618,c={[618]={{61.6,38.6}}}}},e={{k="n",i=10267,n="Tinkee Steamboil",z=46,c={[46]={{65.2,24}}}}},o={"Speak with Tinkee Steamboil."},p={4810},nx={4734}},{i=5047,n="Pip Quickwit, At Your Service!",l=60,r=57,x=6600,f=6,sd=3,h=1,s={{k="n",i=10776,n="Pip Quickwit",z=1583}},e={{k="n",i=10637,n="Malyfous Darkhammer",z=618,c={[618]={{61,38.8}}}}},o={"Talk to Malyfous Darkhammer in Everlook."},nx={5063,5067,5068}},{i=5160,n="The Matron Protectorate",l=60,r=57,x=6600,f=6,sd=3,h=1,s={{k="n",i=10740,n="Awbee",z=1583}},e={{k="n",i=10929,n="Haleh",z=618,c={[618]={{54.5,51.2}}}}},o={"Travel to Winterspring and find Haleh. Give her Awbee's scale."},nx={5161}},{i=8966,n="The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet",l=60,r=58,x=8300,f=6,sd=3,h=5,s={{k="n",i=16033,n="Bodley",z=10074,c={[10074]={{48.9,63.9}}}}},e={{k="n",i=16033,n="Bodley",z=10074,c={[10074]={{48.9,63.9}}}}},o={"Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Mor Grayhoof and slay him. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning."},ot={"Mor Grayhoof","Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet"},p={8962,8963,8964,8965},nx={8970},ex={8967,8968,8969}},{i